{
  "bodyHash": "23b75f70036f5dfc",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">简介</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">这是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quitconfirm\" rel=\"nofollow\">QuitConfirm</a> 的非官方移植版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">作为一个客户端模组，它会弹出一个确认界面或提示框（toast），以防止误退游戏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">功能特性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">支持通过界面或提示框进行确认；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">提供多种可选的确认界面样式；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">高度可配置；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">展示</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">确认界面</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/766/66/quitornotdemo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"184\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">确认提示框</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/766/77/quitornotdemotoast.gif\" width=\"320\" height=\"184\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">许可证</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">QuitConfirm（源项目）采用 MIT 许可证授权。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">QuitOrNot 采用 Nova Relay License 1.0 许可证授权。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:18px\">注意</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace;font-size:12px\">您<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>绝对可以</strong></span>将此模组添加到您的整合包中。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
